{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30017_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a6db721359b6e164fe55c35964083c5a7c0fe837e087af688adccf05afb1c7c7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:449ebbd4a2268dd348a349ed23efe388f53d7dc5e6f06028449c8df90348c899",
      "text": "这一片就是音游区了吧。\n你们两个，有感兴趣的游戏吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc3e4a1a6e914649827ed012a8d62aab08a1fcbca671bef5befb1dceeb1c2e8a",
      "text": "…为了学习，本来打算把各种类型都体验一遍的，\n但是种类太丰富了……一时不知该选哪个好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c906ebc1adf4df413f832e45f3cc7b937fee9cdda06e6241bb0f58e3f664c7bd",
      "text": "…今天一天想把所有的都玩过来，恐怕不太可能。\n果然机台数量多的那些，才是人气款吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:443d4739f2204d3cc58dd4697a14365ecb33d4ce1bd9d1480b4a2acbab25b4f4",
      "text": "排得这么整整齐齐的，确实让人眼花缭乱呢。\n……啊，这个游戏我在视频里看到过！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac8265dbc1e9fa1b265c69dda0c813a5a43f555e161758a9235bc3431800f3f0",
      "text": "喔，是吗！这个看起来是双人对战形式的呢。\n最开始就先玩这个试试看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:235e943940836696af2d58f1522cdc84c5668986a320dbb17201f296ad342bee",
      "text": "嗯！不过，我还是第一次玩呢。\n不知道能不能玩得好……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8046ba5834e061d4fd9205726086be7f8e462dad0e374e31d1b7387e1eae423",
      "text": "总之先玩得开心就好！\n那么凉，对战请多指教啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdc5dfc81657bbd0810e68aea10160b13495cf4b27596143125c2aff2724a94e",
      "text": "哇啊啊啊！输掉了～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3a22fa61878f1311089007968a40f126217c29dcf6c8d927a291819dc6d8b9c",
      "text": "哇哈哈！这个音游只要连击不断，\n好像就能拿高分的样子呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000184:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea0317cc884f4c078413dd47d44d741b00aa7e585ce5e90074ce466ebc2d7f00",
      "text": "这一点跟格斗游戏挺像的嘛。\n那么接下来，换老师和凉试试看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
